  "content": "\n\n<h1>簡易快捷欄</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-hotbar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth 上的 Simple Hotbar\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simple-hotbar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"CurseForge 上的 Simple Hotbar\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon 上的 amongstreality\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee 上的 amongstreality\"></a></p>\n<p>此資源包將更改您的快捷欄、心形與護甲圖示的外觀，並讓連線圖示會根據不同的延遲（ping）數值改變顏色。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>您可以在這裡支持我與我的專案</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>",
